---

<Layout
	title="Wedding Golf Cart Rentals in Central Florida | Masters Golf Cars"
	description="Rent golf carts for weddings in Central Florida. Perfect for outdoor ceremonies, vineyard weddings, and reception transportation. Delivery to Ocala, The Villages & more. Call (352) 307-0111"
	canonical="https://mastersgolfcars.com/golf-cart-rentals-weddings"
	breadcrumbs={[
		{ name: "Home", url: "https://mastersgolfcars.com" },
		{ name: "Rentals", url: "https://mastersgolfcars.com/golf-cart-rentals" },
		{ name: "Wedding Rentals", url: "https://mastersgolfcars.com/golf-cart-rentals-weddings" }
	]}
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="bg-white py-12 md:py-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
				<div>
					<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">Wedding Golf Cart Rentals in Central Florida</h1>
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
						Make your special day unforgettable with golf cart rentals from Masters Golf Cars. Since 1999, we've helped couples throughout Central Florida create magical wedding experiences at venues like <strong>Citra Royal Palm RV Park</strong>, <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong>, <strong>Florida Horse Park</strong>, and beautiful vineyard venues near Ocala.
					</p>
					<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-6">
						Golf carts are perfect for outdoor weddings, transporting guests between ceremony and reception sites, bridal party transportation, and creating memorable photo opportunities. Our fleet includes elegant options for the bride and groom, plus practical carts for guest shuttles.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
						<a href="/rent-a-golf-cart" class="bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition text-center">
							Request Wedding Quote
						</a>
						<a href="tel:3523070111" class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition text-center">
							Call (352) 307-0111
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/club-car_img_v68_250813_154125925.webp" alt="Wedding golf cart rental in Central Florida" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="800" height="600" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Why Golf Carts for Weddings -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">Why Golf Carts Are Perfect for Your Wedding</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<div class="space-y-6">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Outdoor Venue Transportation</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Central Florida is home to stunning outdoor wedding venues where golf carts are essential. From <strong>The Grand Oaks Resort</strong> in Weirsdale to <strong>Citra Royal Palm RV Park</strong> and <strong>Silver Springs State Park</strong>, many venues span large properties where guests need convenient transportation between ceremony, cocktail hour, and reception areas.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Bridal Party & VIP Transport</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Keep the bridal party's attire pristine with dedicated golf cart transportation. Our carts are perfect for transporting the bride and groom, bridesmaids in floor-length gowns, and elderly guests who may have difficulty walking on grass or uneven terrain at venues like <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong> or <strong>Florida Horse Park</strong>.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Photo-Worthy Moments</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Decorated golf carts create memorable photo opportunities against Central Florida's beautiful landscapes. Imagine the newlyweds departing in a decorated cart through the oak-lined drives of <strong>Golden Ocala</strong> or past the vineyards near <strong>Lakeridge Winery</strong>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/golf-cart-rentals-in-the-villages_img_v69_250813_160043497.webp" alt="Golf cart for wedding transportation" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg mb-6" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Wedding Package Options</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold">
							<li>• Single cart for bride & groom</li>
							<li>• Multiple carts for bridal party</li>
							<li>• Guest shuttle service fleet</li>
							<li>• Weekend-long rentals available</li>
							<li>• Delivery to any Central Florida venue</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Popular Wedding Venues -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-brand-green text-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-12 text-center">Popular Wedding Venues We Serve</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">World Equestrian Center</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Ocala, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						This stunning equestrian venue hosts spectacular weddings with its European-inspired architecture. Golf carts are essential for navigating the expansive grounds.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">The Grand Oaks Resort</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Weirsdale, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Romantic lakefront resort perfect for destination weddings. Golf cart shuttles help guests navigate between ceremony sites, reception venues, and overnight accommodations.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Florida Horse Park</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Ocala, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Beautiful outdoor venue surrounded by Central Florida's horse country. Perfect for rustic outdoor ceremonies with golf cart guest transportation.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Citra Royal Palm RV Park</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Citra, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Charming venue with Southern hospitality. Golf carts provide elegant transportation for outdoor ceremonies among palm trees and gardens.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Silver Springs State Park</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Silver Springs, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Natural Florida beauty with crystal-clear springs. Golf carts help wedding parties navigate between parking, ceremony sites, and reception areas.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">The Villages Town Squares</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">The Villages, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Unique wedding venue options with Spanish Springs, Lake Sumter Landing, and Brownwood Paddock Square. Golf carts are part of the lifestyle here.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Lakeridge Winery</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Clermont, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Florida's largest premium winery offers gorgeous vineyard weddings. Golf carts shuttle guests through the beautiful rolling hills and grape vines.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Mission Inn Resort</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Howey-in-the-Hills, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Historic resort with Spanish-style architecture and stunning golf courses. Golf cart transportation is essential for this expansive property.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Golden Ocala Golf Club</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">Ocala, FL</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						Elegant clubhouse and championship golf course provide a refined wedding backdrop. Golf carts offer convenient access to ceremony and reception sites.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Wedding Rental Options -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-12 text-center">Wedding Golf Cart Options</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/2-seater-golf-cart_img_v63_250813_142814136.webp" alt="2-passenger wedding golf cart" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Bride & Groom Cart</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm text-gray-700">
						Perfect for the newlyweds' grand exit or intimate transportation between ceremony and reception venues.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto text-gray-700">
						<li>• Seats 2 passengers comfortably</li>
						<li>• Can be decorated for photos</li>
						<li>• Elegant transportation</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/4-seater-golf-cart_img_v64_250813_142836603.webp" alt="4-passenger wedding golf cart" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Bridal Party Cart</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm text-gray-700">
						Ideal for transporting bridesmaids, groomsmen, or family members together to ceremony and photo locations.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto text-gray-700">
						<li>• Seats 4 passengers</li>
						<li>• Perfect for bridal party</li>
						<li>• Great for group photos</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/6-seater-golf-cart_img_v65_250813_142855008.webp" alt="6-passenger wedding guest shuttle" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Guest Shuttle</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm text-gray-700">
						Perfect for shuttling guests from parking to ceremony or between venues at larger wedding sites.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto text-gray-700">
						<li>• Seats up to 6 guests</li>
						<li>• Continuous shuttle service</li>
						<li>• Elderly/mobility assistance</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/utility-cart_img_v66_250813_142912878.webp" alt="Utility cart for wedding supplies" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Utility Cart</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm text-gray-700">
						Behind-the-scenes cart for vendors, caterers, and wedding coordinators to transport supplies and equipment.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto text-gray-700">
						<li>• Cargo bed for supplies</li>
						<li>• Perfect for vendors</li>
						<li>• Setup and breakdown help</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Why Choose Us for Weddings -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">Why Couples Choose Masters Golf Cars</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
				<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-lg">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">26+ Years of Event Experience</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
						Since 1999, we've provided golf cart rentals for countless weddings, receptions, and special events throughout Central Florida. We understand the importance of reliable transportation on your special day.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 font-semibold">
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand-green text-xl mr-3">✓</span>
							<span>On-time delivery guaranteed</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand-green text-xl mr-3">✓</span>
							<span>Clean, well-maintained carts</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand-green text-xl mr-3">✓</span>
							<span>Flexible pickup and delivery</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand-green text-xl mr-3">✓</span>
							<span>Experienced with venue requirements</span>
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand-green text-xl mr-3">✓</span>
							<span>Backup carts available if needed</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-lg">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Full-Service Wedding Support</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
						We work with your wedding coordinator, venue, and vendors to ensure seamless golf cart logistics. Our team can deliver carts the day before your wedding for venue setup convenience.
					</p>
					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 mt-6">
						<h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Our Wedding Service Includes:</h4>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">
							<li>• Venue delivery coordination</li>
							<li>• Day-before setup available</li>
							<li>• Instructions for drivers</li>
							<li>• Emergency contact support</li>
							<li>• Multi-day rental discounts</li>
							<li>• Fleet options for large weddings</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- How to Reserve -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">How to Reserve Wedding Golf Carts</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
				<div class="space-y-8">
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">1</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Submit Your Wedding Date</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								Complete our rental inquiry form with your wedding date, venue location (such as <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong>, <strong>Florida Horse Park</strong>, or your private venue), and number of carts needed.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">2</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Receive Your Custom Quote</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								Our wedding rental specialist will contact you to discuss your specific needs and provide a custom quote. We'll work with your timeline and budget.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">3</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Coordinate with Your Venue</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								We'll coordinate delivery timing with your venue and wedding coordinator. Carts can be delivered the day before for setup convenience.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">4</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Enjoy Your Special Day</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								Focus on celebrating while our clean, reliable carts handle all your transportation needs. We pick up after your event at a time that works for you.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/gallery/02-04-2025-14-28-23_33.webp" alt="Wedding golf cart delivery" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg mb-8" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
