							<li>• Decoration-friendly carts</li>
							<li>• Fleet discounts for multiple carts</li>
						</ul>
						<a href="/rent-a-golf-cart" class="inline-block bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition w-full text-center">
							Request Wedding Quote
