			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Perfect addition to our outdoor wedding at Citra Royal Palm RV Park! The decorated golf cart made for amazing photos and our guests loved the shuttle service."
					</p>
